# Appa, Steadfast Guardian makes an Ally "whenever you cast a spell from exile" (CR 601.2a, where the spell was cast
# from): Lingering Souls cast from hand on turn 1 and again with flashback from the graveyard on turn 3 are casts from
# the hand and from the graveyard, not from exile, so Bot1 gets four Spirits and no Ally. (Flashback exiles the card only
# after it has been cast, CR 702.34a.)

